      "message": "There are three instances where `xmit_status` is set to `TCPC_TX_UNSET`:\n1) [prl_init](https://source.chromium.org/chromiumos/chromiumos/codesearch/+/main:src/platform/ec/common/usbc/usb_prl_sm.c;drc\u003d1afd124529bf7048ef47bb49d96e1820e53fd4db;l\u003d596)\n2) [prl_tx_wait_for_message_request_entry](https://source.chromium.org/chromiumos/chromiumos/codesearch/+/main:src/platform/ec/common/usbc/usb_prl_sm.c;drc\u003d1afd124529bf7048ef47bb49d96e1820e53fd4db;l\u003d885)\n3) [prl_hr_send_msg_to_phy](https://source.chromium.org/chromiumos/chromiumos/codesearch/+/main:src/platform/ec/common/usbc/usb_prl_sm.c;drc\u003d1afd124529bf7048ef47bb49d96e1820e53fd4db;l\u003d1309)",
