      "message": "This was in `pujjoga port0` in which it was passing consistently with this CL. It is consistently failing in `pujjoga port0` while using a local variable. However, it passes in `pujjoga port1` with and without using a local variable in this CL.\nIt still fails in `both ports` of `magolor` with and without using a local variable in this CL.",
